### Naura Hoshino V2 - Dashboard & Core REST API Collection
### Kompatibel dengan VS Code / Antigravity REST Client & Bruno

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Health Check Endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Telemetry & Bot Realtime Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats
Accept: application/json

### 3. User Session Info (Dashboard Auth Profile)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/me
Accept: application/json

### 4. Guilds List (Memerlukan sesi login Discord)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/guilds
Accept: application/json

### 5. Leaderboard Economy & Survival Top 30
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leaderboard
Accept: application/json
